// A thunk handed to `spawn` under the parallel schedule, inside a body
// declared `!E`, where the thunk performs E. The contract is the refusal.
//
// Measured 2026-09-23 through the pinned boot: check clean. The arm hands
// the thunk to the host's task import and never calls it in the language,
// so no call charges the thunk's row. A closure handed across a host
// boundary is charged as called (Hβ.effects.rows-are-propagated-cells).
effect E { op() -> Int }
fn bad() with !E = {
  let t = spawn(() => op())
  thread_join(t)
} ~> parallel_compose
fn main() = 0
